5/AVE-2025-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0633","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0633.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-20260","title":"ClamAV PDF扫描缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ClamAV PDF 扫描引擎在处理 PDF 文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122）。由于内存缓冲区分配不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备提交特制的 PDF 文件触发该漏洞，导致 ClamAV 扫描进程崩溃并造成拒绝服务（DoS）条件。虽然尚未被证实，但攻击者也有可能利用该缓冲区溢出漏洞以 ClamAV 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 ClamAV 1.4.3 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-20260"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T18:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:41:12Z","remediation":"立即将 ClamAV 升级至 1.4.3 或 1.0.9 版本（分别对应 1.4.x 和 1.0.x LTS 分支），可从 clamav.net/downloads 或 GitHub Releases 获取。如无法立即升级，可在 clamd.conf 中将 MaxFileSize 设为 1000M 以下且 MaxScanSize 设为 1024M 以下作为临时缓解措施。Debian 用户可通过 apt update && apt upgrade 安装安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.clamav.net/2025/06/clamav-143-and-109-security-patch.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/09/msg00006.html","https://github.com/Alex-Acero-Security/CVE-2025-20260-POC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-20260.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2025/CVE-2025-20260.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b8843912aad5f3df7a6246b49ce2c90d39da4b12/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-20260.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/20xxx/CVE-2025-20260.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/52ab10bd804e22d7a1e3ce8d118700d9c56bd957/2025/CVE-2025-20260.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/20xxx/CVE-2025-20260.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b8843912aad5f3df7a6246b49ce2c90d39da4b12/data/2025/CVE-2025-20260-keyuraghao_CVE-2025-20260.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CV